batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3363400","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:53:58Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4692730","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1846018067925887","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"update","title":"Clue Update","summary":"In preparation for Steam Next Fest, the demo has just been updated with a hint system. Those clues are entirely optional, of course, and require a unanimous vote to be unlocked. I still want the game to be feasible without any hint but I don't want people to be stuck in the story forever so... use it as you please :)Feel free to give it another go and leave your feedback :)Le DoubleSept","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T12:06:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925887","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1844751498226897","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"announcement","title":"TriHebdo#8 - Sketching Life","summary":"Hello,In this news post, I'm presenting how I create the game's assets (spoiler: it's done by hand, much longer than \"I prompt and cross my fingers\")But first, a quick project status over the last 3 weeks:New assets for Chapter 2Porting the demo's technical improvements into the base gameCreating a working build of the base game for SteamThe creation processThe game's second chapter takes place in a nightclub called \"Le Nez Rouge\", at the center of which is a room that serves as a hub for most o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T09:56:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226897","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1842846814451515","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"announcement","title":"TriHebdo#7 - A new chapter","summary":"Helloo, how are you doing? I'm doing well.Just so you know, the demo is out, so feel free to dive right in. The last two weeks before launch were still packed with playtests and small tweaks to make the experience as enjoyable as possible.On my end, I'm steadily moving forward on the second chapter, and I'm heading right back to drawing the assets for it, aiming for a March 11, 2027 release.Here is the draft of the environment. In the next TriHebdo, I'll walk you through the different steps from","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T19:10:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451515","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1842212951311150","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is out now!","summary":"Hello, this announcement is going to be extremely short because... the demo is out!Needless to say, I'm really eager for your feedback. Don't hesitate to reach out if you run into any issues along the way.Rally your friends and set off to discover Escape With Friends!Have fun, DoubleSept","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T18:27:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311150","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1840944183781602","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"announcement","title":"TriHebdo#6 - Demo, Demo and Networking","summary":"🎵 It's the tri-hebdo news, where we talk about three news each three weeeeks 🎵I decided to find a little jingle for this segment, but then I realized it's written, which inevitably makes it considerably less good.Anyway, what am I going to talk about? The deeeeemo, of course, and a bit of networking.Quick TLDR: the demo will release on September 1st, 2026 on Steam (and it might already be accessible to some lucky folks).So what's in the demo?It lasts about thirty minutes and contains a modified ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T08:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781602","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1839041357034059","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"announcement","title":"TriHebdo#5 - Polishing, Quality of Life and Heatwaves","summary":"Welcome to this new tri-weekly update.With summer and the French heatwaves, my work pace hasn't been as intense as I'd have liked.Quality of lifeSince the game is made up of many mini-games, I need to work on each one to make its interface intuitive on first contact. So I've made a batch of \"quality of life\" improvements based on recent feedback. The next post will take a detailed look at how one of these mini-games evolved, from the first tests in December 2025 to its final version in the demo.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T16:53:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357034059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1836506165573666","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"announcement","title":"TriHebdo#4 - Feedback, Communication and Demo","summary":"Hello, back with a bit of news on progress, mainly: first feedback, communication, and focus on the demo.Feedback on Chapter 1I've mentioned it before, but Chapter 1 is being tested from all sides, and unlike my last blood tests, most of the results are positive :)I'm fixing the hints for a few puzzles and trying to smooth out the difficulty curve a bit, but overall I'm satisfied and aware that what I need now is ...CommunicationI'm very, very timidly starting to look into this unbearable aspect","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-05T08:47:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165573666","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1835236783567350","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"announcement","title":"Trihebdo#3 - Optimizations and Cutscenes","summary":"Hello everyone,I can finally say it: CHAPTER 1 IS DONE!!!!It's even been tested from start to finish, which revealed two new challenges...OptimizationsThere's a catch to developing on a gaming PC with tons of RAM and a great graphics card... optimization issues only show up during testing. This was a brand new field for me, and the goal is to make this not-too-complex 2D game run smoothly on any decent Linux or Windows PC from the last ten years. So I set up a test environment with three compute","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T09:09:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783567350","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1831432155575055","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"announcement","title":"Trihebdo#2 - Music and Chapter 1","summary":"Hello, hello, How's the project going? New mini-games, Chapter 1 testing, hint system and music update — I'm covering all of that in this second Trihebdo update. Remember to Wishlist (please)!Asset of the moment We kick things off with a second piece of out of context scenery.Difficulty and hints As announced in the previous update, full playtesting of the first chapter should begin by the end of the month. However, this week I ran the first presentation of the Chapter 1, and the first complete ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-03T09:00:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155575055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3363400-1829528821311933","game_id":"steam-3363400","kind":"announcement","title":"Release Date, NextFest and more (trihebdo#1)","summary":"Hello, I've finally decided to start communicating regularly, so I'm launching three-weekly news updates, woohoo!It'll be short but it'll allow me to give an update on the game's progress, and speaking of which...New release dateI had set myself a goal of releasing in October 2026. It was still doable but it meant releasing only the first chapter of the adventure (see below). However, I'd rather have a bit more content for the launch, so I've decided to push it back to March 11, 2027 to offer yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-11T09:35:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821311933","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3363400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:39:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:39:33Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3363400":"2026-10-26T00:39:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3363400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:39:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T